-- the laws used, bundled. Of the scalars: x·0 = 0, x + 0 = x, 0 + x = x, (s·x)·y = s·(x·y), (x + y) + w = x + (y + w)
sy-RL : (A : Type) → A → (A → A → A) → (A → A → A) → Type
sy-RL A z ad mu = ((x : A) → mu x z ≡ z) × (((x : A) → ad x z ≡ x) × (((x : A) → ad z x ≡ x) × (((s x y : A) → mu (mu s x) y ≡ mu s (mu x y)) × ((x y w : A) → ad (ad x y) w ≡ ad x (ad y w)))))
